From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 21:28:04 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8132-j604: Add the AOP speaker and V/I
 sense channels

The J604 AOP runs the J614s/J616s speaker stream (ADT
/arm-io/iop-audio-controller/audio-speaker): playback on the base-ns
ADMAC's channel 0 (TX0) and the amps' voltage and current sense on
channel 1 (RX0), through AOP DART stream 8, as on the J713. Name both
channels, so the AOP audio component registers its speaker back-end
and the sense front-end.

The sense channel is what speaker protection runs on: the speaker
card's third front-end, which the protection daemon captures to model
the voice coils and to keep renewing the speaker volume lease. The AOP
speaker component arms it before every playback start, so a speaker
stream never runs without it.

No card links the speaker back-end yet.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts | 13 ++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
index 0b6c653204..38a7e6abaf 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
@@ -750,9 +750,16 @@
 };
 
 &aop_audio {
-	/* The microphones on LEAP, the jack on base-ns TX2 and RX2. */
-	dmas = <&admac0 1>, <&admac1 4>, <&admac1 5>; /* DTV-AUD-7..9 */
-	dma-names = "dma", "cout", "cin";
+	/*
+	 * The microphones on LEAP; the speakers and their V/I sense on base-ns
+	 * TX0 and RX0 (ADT iop-audio-controller/audio-speaker dma-channels: the
+	 * J614s/J616s stream, six playback and twelve sense slots); the jack on
+	 * TX2 and RX2. The sense channel feeds the speaker card's sense PCM,
+	 * which the protection daemon reads to hold the speaker volume lease.
+	 */
+	dmas = <&admac0 1>, <&admac1 0>, <&admac1 1>, <&admac1 4>,
+	       <&admac1 5>; /* DTV-AUD-7..9, DTV-SPK-18a, DTV-SPK-18b */
+	dma-names = "dma", "spkr", "sense", "cout", "cin";
 	apple,chassis-name = "J604";
 	apple,machine-kind = "MacBook Pro";
 };
